From 9becbec006a3e361cb86ade73d3fd27bfc63394a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Mazlan, Hazwan Arif" <hazwan.arif.mazlan@intel.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 14:37:35 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] drm/xe/nvl-s: Enable PXP for NVL-S

Now that the GSC FW is defined (and already present in this tree with
the corrected 108.1.0 compatibility version), enable PXP for NVL-S.
The feature will only be turned on if the binary is found on disk.

Cherry-pick: f67c294414f8683f843593524d35802db9f9b7df
("drm/xe/nvl-s: Enable PXP for NVL-S")

Signed-off-by: Mazlan, Hazwan Arif <hazwan.arif.mazlan@intel.com>
Co-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 drivers/gpu/drm/xe/xe_pci.c | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/xe/xe_pci.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/xe/xe_pci.c
index 5f2a0b19839d..18b267e1c0ba 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/xe/xe_pci.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/xe/xe_pci.c
@@ -459,6 +459,7 @@ static const struct xe_device_desc nvls_desc = {
 	.has_flat_ccs = 1,
 	.has_pre_prod_wa = 1,
 	.has_sriov = true,
+	.has_pxp = true,
 	.max_gt_per_tile = 2,
 	MULTI_LRC_MASK,
 	.va_bits = 48,
-- 
2.43.0

